# Downloaded training data — large, regenerable via ml/data_sources.py; never commit.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
# Collection provenance is committed (hashes of exactly the data a result was computed on); the data itself is not.
!raw/
raw/*
!raw/phreshphish/
raw/phreshphish/*
!raw/phreshphish/MANIFEST.json
# The payload-list manifest (file hashes of the SecLists / PayloadsAllTheThings lists used) and the dataset provenance (the hashes the
# URL results were computed on) are committed; the lists and the Parquet files are not.
!raw/payloads/
raw/payloads/*
!raw/payloads/MANIFEST.json
!processed/
processed/*
!processed/PROVENANCE.json
